#ASSERT `ss 300, 313, 316, 323 -- can the law practice sue me for costs` TRUE (`the calendar date` 1 6 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE (`the calendar date` 10 6 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`the calendar date` 9 7 2026) EQUALS `TOO EARLY`
